name\":\"Yuen Wah\",\"character\":\"Master Guang Bo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yMkMgs0tWlJXdTjYkiMcjvhYnRw.jpg\"},{\"id\":1998541,\"name\":\"Florian Munteanu\",\"character\":\"Razor Fist\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lE26A169mjuwW5x0zx2wW9Q9o2w.jpg\"},{\"id\":1068877,\"name\":\"Andy Le\",\"character\":\"Death Dealer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/46hI8q3ufjUsYZ3rSTYP8AnOvRc.jpg\"},{\"id\":3074780,\"name\":\"Paul He\",\"character\":\"Chancellor Hui\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uTFu9bgW3Q8XcgII2iXoAgRXovY.jpg\"},{\"id\":3201062,\"name\":\"Jayden Tianyi Zhang\",\"character\":\"Young Shang-Chi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sn7aVeh4Av1ETcVvy9hLOlvpP0.jpg\"},{\"id\":3218942,\"name\":\"Elodie Fong\",\"character\":\"Young Xialing\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hSVUbKxEGPdA7ZjGXyTbScJgtSW.jpg\"},{\"id\":3216792,\"name\":\"Arnold Sun\",\"character\":\"Teen Shang-Chi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eGiLC3QRUJTuemp3ziG9EPHe623.jpg\"},{\"id\":1381186,\"name\":\"Stephanie Hsu\",\"character\":\"Soo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8gb3lfIHKQAGOQyeC4ynQPsCiHr.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1368337,\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c7btGYblBnfAaw713WvFM0Kimc7.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980431,\"title\":\"Avatar Aang: The Last Airbender\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3sgnSfNT27Bx5O5ukr7B26mhEQq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":120,\"title\":\"The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6oom5QYQ2yQTMJIbnvbkBL9cHo6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oiwc338EoBgS4sEI2ixAny4KQKg.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young hobbit Frodo Baggins, after inheriting a mysterious ring from his uncle Bilbo, must leave his home in order to keep it from falling into the hands of its evil creator. Along the way, a fellowship is formed to protect the ringbearer and make sure that the ring arrives at its final destination: Mt. Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":453395,\"title\":\"Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ddJcSKbcp4rKZTmuyWaMhuwcfMz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AdyJH8kDm8xT8IKTlgpEC15ny4u.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Doctor Strange, with the help of mystical allies both old and new, traverses the mind-bending and dangerous alternate realities of the Multiverse to confront a mysterious new adversary.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":122917,\"title\":\"The Hobbit: The Battle of the Five Armies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xT98tLqatZPQApyRmlPL12LtiWp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3UbaCMmqOd7mca4Y5DOzY2ZVTyX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following Smaug's attack on Laketown, Bilbo and the dwarves try to defend Erebor's mountain of treasure from others who claim it: the men of the ruined Laketown and the elves of Mirkwood. Meanwhile an army of Orcs led by Azog the Defiler is marching on Erebor, fueled by the rise of the dark lord Sauron. Dwarves, elves and men must unite, and the hope for Middle-Earth falls into Bilbo's hands.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22,\"title\":\"Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/poHwCZeWzJCShH7tOjg8RIoyjcw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uRNgkJSkNBFbbn9fPsEjDIy8Sh3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When wily pirate Captain Barbossa seizes Jack Sparrow’s beloved ship, the Black Pearl, and kidnaps the governor’s daughter, Elizabeth Swann, blacksmith Will Turner reluctantly teams up with the unpredictable pirate Jack to rescue her—only to uncover a terrifying curse that turns Barbossa’s crew into the undead.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980477,\"title\":\"Ne Zha 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fcs5AdCKliQaQgXsPS9kDejamIJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gd9kxeEEONj5SECs4GA8Ddn3czI.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a catastrophic event leaves their bodies destroyed, Ne Zha and Ao Bing are granted a fragile second chance at life. As tensions rise between the dragon clans and celestial forces, the two must undergo a series of perilous trials that will test their bond, challenge their identities, and decide the fate of both mortals and immortals.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":931285,\"title\":\"Mortal Kombat II\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hwRdDFIhaEmpRgoki805YvyyjZf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4EAAwpylq313qrDqpCxulUrXBNF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The fan favorite champions—now joined by Johnny Cage himself—are pitted against one another in the ultimate, no-holds barred, gory battle to defeat the dark rule of Shao Kahn that threatens the very existence of the Earthrealm and its defenders.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1061474,\"title\":\"Superman\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ombsmhYUqR4qqOLOxAyr5V8hbyv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eGX66zonvc4bXg3rM08RUxdYSDx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Superman, a journalist in Metropolis, embarks on a journey to reconcile his Kryptonian heritage with his human upbringing as Clark Kent.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":287947,\"title\":\"Shazam!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xnopI5Xtky18MPhK40cZAGAOVeV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o7JVhqMmrex1TPbmuxl8YXVlcfl.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A boy is given the ability to become an adult superhero in times of need with a single magic word.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"8YjFbMbfXaQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"az2sQoPocUQ\",\"name\":\"All\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"2FLImUzLS80\",\"name\":\"One Name\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}